  aciklama:
  - "B\xF6yle bak\u0131m\u0131 kolay ve k\u0131sa sa\xE7lara bay\u0131l\u0131yorum.
    Sa\xE7lar\u0131n bir hayli de g\xFCr duruyor {{isim}}. Sa\xE7 s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
